Subject: [PATCH 23/26] arm64: dts: gtactive2lte: simplefb is XRGB8888
 (x8r8g8b8)

The boot firmware leaves DECON scanning out XRGB8888; declaring
x8b8g8r8 made simpledrm swap red and blue.

